slides.chunk:
But ye [are] a chosen generation,
a royal priesthood, an holy
nation, a peculiar people;

and the singers, and [some] of the
people, and the Nethinims, and all
Israel, dwelt in their cities;

And beside this, giving all
diligence, add to your faith
virtue; and to virtue knowledge;
And to knowledge temperance;

These things have I written unto
you that believe on the name of
the Son of God;
